# Files Docker leaves out of the image build (COPY . .).
# Without this, every build copied ~4.2 GB into the image and took ~10 minutes
# just to copy the folder and set file ownership.

# Local Windows virtual environment (2.4 GB): useless inside the Linux image
.venv/
venv/

# Local model files (llama-3.2-3b GGUF, 1.9 GB) used to build the Ollama model
# on the host; nothing in the containers reads them
**/*.gguf

# Caches and local runtime files
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
celerybeat-schedule*

# Never bake secrets into an image (the containers get them from env_file)
**/.env
**/.env.*
